class Solution {
    public List<List<String>> groupAnagrams(String[] strs) {
        Map<String, List<String>>  map = new HashMap<>();

        for(int i=0; i < strs.length; i++){
            String originalStr = strs[i];
            char ch[] = strs[i].toCharArray();
            Arrays.sort(ch);
            String sortedStr = String.valueOf(ch);
            map.computeIfAbsent(sortedStr, k -> new ArrayList<>());
            map.get(sortedStr).add(originalStr);
        }
        return new ArrayList<>(map.values());
    }
    
}

Time : O(n * k log k)
O(n) -> iteratiomn
O(k log k) -> sorting each string

Space : O(n * k)
for every k length string, it is storing list of strings
